name:Prophetia (Osee 6);
office-part:Lectio;
book:Text Missale O.P. (1939), p. 166; inflexion marks (flex sign and colons) from Officium Hebdomadæ Sanctæ / Triduum O.P. (1927), p. 179;
commentary:Set to the Dominican tone for lessons and the prophecies at Mass (Processionarium O.P. 1913, pp. 408-413, ending by n. 11, p. 413). Rubric: "legatur ... a fratre ... Prophetia ex Osee Propheta sine ullo titulo" (Missal p. 166, the Prior meanwhile "legat submissa voce Prophetiam");
